Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.81,Title,,0,0,0,,Lucky gun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.81,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs39\pos(368.178,577)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd thought I could come over there to play with you. But sorry, I won't be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She rejected me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think that, I had saved yesterday's cake for Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, just for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll eat it all by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's all bad luck for me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we have a guest and this cake is all we have for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is not my day, I want to read my Manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are my Manga that I had put on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.57,0:00:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy took them so that he can read them while riding on train.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How unlucky I'm today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:00:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, do you have any gadget to change my luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Not... Maybe yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you pointing that gun towards me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Revolver with four consecutive bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 3 reds and 1 black bullet in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Load them up and spin it....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were shot by a red bullet, you'll have good luck for the entire day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.76,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if you were shot bythe black bullet, your entire day will be unlucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, why don't you please put that black bullet away?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.02,0:01:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If bullets are not loaded together, they won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.90,0:01:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you can't get any good luck without risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.78,0:01:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus red bullets are 3X more than the black bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,3X, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's try it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.25,0:01:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Pull the trigger quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't do it! I'm so afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.05,0:02:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! Let's try it out on someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull the trigger like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's red bullet, then it's good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But if it's black bullet, your luck on that day won't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You can try the first shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? But that sounds scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.33,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're usually very careful with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me have a try then!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, I feel very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be red one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, a red bullet is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Nobi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot very important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought you some souvenir from when I went to travel overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I had told you before!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I always feel it's a black bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Men have to be bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bold?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use the black bullet first on someone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can reliably shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me play, let me play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I love this kind of game the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.31,0:03:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.23,0:03:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a remaining black bullet which brings bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm scared to try this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The black bullet will probably fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a red bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling very good and very happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:03:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, shall I take you for a movie today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks Daddy! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got the circle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy Giant, I should've tried it before giving to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still 1 red shot, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it boldly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this time it's black bullet that will be shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible that all three red bullets would be fired in sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo-{\i1}kun{\i0}, you talk too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to feel extraordinarily lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If a red bullet is shot, then you'll have good luck for an entire day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the black bullet is shot, You'll have bad luck for the entire day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you girls? All of you are so timid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You should talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, girls! I'll do it to prove that I'm a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am pulling the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be a black bullet now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's the remaining red bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo is actually so bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.19,0:05:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry. Let's go and play together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your fault that there's only but the black bullet is what remains!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This revolver sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to just throw it away like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't point it at me! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away. I'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hide here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy thinks we're playing with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Found ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing good will happen with me for the next 24 hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You always bully him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.50,0:05:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, {\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All our savings for the whole year is gone in water!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Being hasty will only bring back luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.05,0:06:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,let's be careful and go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.34,0:06:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're unlucky for the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful ...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my god
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's consider today as a day of bad luck and then forget all about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make me feel better.
